    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled in a tranquil lakeside setting in the heart of County Leitrim, No. 9 Lakeside Cottage is a charming detached residence offering the perfect blend of comfort, privacy, and natural beauty. Set amidst beautifully maintained grounds with mature trees and expansive green spaces, this attractive stone-fronted home enjoys a peaceful countryside atmosphere while remaining conveniently accessible to nearby towns and amenities.\nThe property is thoughtfully designed to provide bright and spacious accommodation, with well-proportioned living areas and generous bedroom accommodation ideal for families, holidaymakers, or those seeking a relaxing rural retreat. \nLocated close to the shores of Lough Scur, the property offers easy access to fishing, boating, walking trails, and a wide range of outdoor pursuits. The nearby towns of Drumshanbo, Carrick-on-Shannon, and Ballinamore provide excellent shopping, dining, and recreational facilities, making this an ideal base for both permanent living and holiday enjoyment. The accommodation comprises a kitchenette, spacious Living room, Bathroom, No 3 Bedrooms (1 ensuite). \nNo. 9 Lakeside Cottage presents a rare opportunity to acquire a beautifully positioned property in one of Leitrim's most scenic and peaceful locations. Viewing Strictly by Appointment Only with Sole Selling Agent."
      },
